source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A lone backslash Jira keeps, because the character after it is not escapable, blocks the pair from breaking; jiro reads all three backslashes as literal text.
-- input.jira --
a\\b\c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\\b\c</p>
-- want.md --
a\\\\b\\c
-- warnings.json --
[]
